    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sniper Simulator is a real sniping simulation app.</h2><br><u><strong>\u3010Teaching mode\u3011</strong></u><br>The most valuable part of learning sniping.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real sniping range card data and related shooting terms.<br></li><li>Use mil division to complete the distance measurement of the shooting target.<br></li><li>Query the range card and correct the sniper elevation.<br></li><li>Windage calculation at different wind speed and wind direction.<br></li><li>Windage correction by MOA and mil.</li></ul><br><u><strong>\u3010Training mode\u3011</strong></u><br>The difficulty of shooting gradually increases. Apply the knowledge provided by the tutorial, experience the real calculation process of a sniper.<br><br><u><strong>\u3010Grassland roaming mode\u3011</strong></u><br>Wander through the vast grasslands. Silently lurking, with a light step, chasing the trail of prey.",
